{"product_id":"smok-slm-pod-kit","title":"SMOK SLM 16W Pod Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe SMOK SLM 16W Ultra Portable Pod Kit presents one of the slimmest and lightweight vape pen to-date, integrating a 250mAh rechargeable battery with 0.8mL juice capacity and air-driven coil system for a sensational MTL Nic Salts experience. Leveraging the success of previous pod systems, SMOKTech crafted the SLM with a sleek and thin chassis design with streamline form factor for comfortable all-day use. Internally, SMOK has managed to integrate a 250mAh internal battery within the SLM Stick Thick Vapor, with LED light indicator to provide instant battery life feedback and is conveniently charged via microUSB port.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eQuick Links:\u003cbr\u003eSMOK SLM Replacement Pod Cartridges\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSMOK SLM Ultra Portable Pod Kit Features:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDimensions - 112mm by 12mm by 9.5mm\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIntegrated 250mAh Rechargeable Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWattage Output Range: 10-16W\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVoltage Input Range: 3.3-4.2V\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDirect Voltage Based Output\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDraw-Activated Firing Mechanism\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLED Light Battery Indicator\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUltra Slim \u0026amp;amp; Lightweight Design\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFillable Pod System - Replaceable Cartridge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e0.8mL Juice Capacity - Side-Fill Slot\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eElongated Chimney - Coil Atomizer\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAir-Driven Pod System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eErgonomically Sleek Mouthpiece\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8 Seconds Cut-Off Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eShort-Circuit Protection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLow Voltage Warning\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMicroUSB Port Charging System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProprietary Magnetized Connection\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIncludes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 SLM Vape Pen Battery\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 SLM Replacement Pods\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 MicroUSB Cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 Instructional Manual\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"SMOK","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41990960611383,"sku":"Smok SLM Pod Kit","price":2999.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/smok_slm_16w_pod_system_black.webp?v=1763431764","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/smok-slm-pod-kit","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




